# Lacroix et al., Nature 645, 614 (2025), arXiv:2412.14256 -- App. I.1 Fig. 15 / Fig. 5
# Lattice-surgery teleportation L1 -> L2 (two d=3 superdense color codes), M_XX via
# 3 merge cycles + 1 split cycle.  Input |-_L> on L1, L2 read out in X.
# RECONSTRUCTED from the paper's figures (no circuit file was published for this
# experiment).  Gates are the CNOTs drawn in Fig. 15 (before compilation to H+CZ).
# QUBIT_COORDS = (row, col) on the 72-qubit grid; placement offset (+0,+3) from
# figure coordinates is OUR choice: the paper does not give chip coordinates.
# DETECTOR coords = (row, col, cycle, chromobius basis/color; -1 = flag/ignore).
# OBSERVABLE 0 = teleported logical after the frame update Z_L^m1 X_L^m2 on L2.
